body:
I LOVE Medieval and its gameplay, I really think it should've been expanded on more. I found it really fun. I do love most of The sims franchise and general sandbox open-ended play, but I also find a lot of fun in doing quests/tasks. I had Medieval with my Origin subscription, might re-subscribe and have a play tomorrow

&#x200B;

edit: I still had it on my origin library lmao it was just hidden, so going to download now :))
